 * The page column. The floating navbar pill is `max-w-2xl` wide; content and
 * footer share that width and sit a little inside the pill's edges.
 * Every page gets it through `layouts/Base.astro`: do not add other width wrappers.
 */
---

<div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl px-4 sm:px-8">
  <slot />
</div>
